6_1225668104991054_2069936562898724076_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5ibxYTIvLsQQ7kNvwHqouX1&_nc_oc=AdrR6DyDqTj_Qd2c3k_7VcbPr0YrGmvg6NQyJ18e73bk8QmZMv44cJMjOTB_EvGDOZI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTu9D6R8Y5EZxCiLV2JkVUSMK8hzeLgEYV_kUR2Y5dtbw&oe=6B030C51"}, "display_name": "ZOSU Zoo Demo", "keywords": [], "long_description": "ZOSU Zoo Demo\n- Demo of \"ZOSU Zoo\"\n- This is a relaxing and simple zoo experience with 40+ land animals to see, restricted access in the demo with a fence (can't see all animals in the demo due to the fence)\n- As a bonus, on mostly random spawners there are an additional 100+ sea creatures (they will not all be visible each play session), restricted access in the demo with a fence\n\nGameplay:\n- In the demo there is a fence, the full game has no fence with full exploration available (can climb or jump over obstacles or into enclosures in full game)\n- Run and jump to find the eagles! (climb almost anything in full game)", "short_description": "ZOSU Zoo Demo\n- Demo of \"ZOSU Zoo\"\n- This is a relaxing and simple zoo experience with 40+ land animals to see, restricted access in the demo with fence (can't see all)\n- Also on mostly random spawners there are an additional 100+ sea creatures (they will not all be visible each play session), restricted access in the demo with a fence\n\nGameplay:\n- In the demo there is a fence, the full game has no fence with full exploration available\n- Run and jump to find the eagles! (climbing in full)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.zosustudio.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.zosustudio.com/", "publisher_name": "ZOSU Studios LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.zosustudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics":